    name: "Word Highlight Reveal",
    category: "Scroll",
    blurb: "A paragraph arrives one word at a time as you scroll: each word surfaces as a blank grey pill, then the word itself fades up inside it just as the pill clears — and once the passage is whole, the same wave runs back through it, taking the words away and leaving the pills behind.",
